00:46:55.512 --> 00:46:57.681
FOLLOWED THEIR INTERESTS. JOAN

00:46:57.748 --> 00:46:59.283
LOVED THE ARTS, CULTURE AND

00:46:59.349 --> 00:47:00.884
HEALTH, WHILE IRWIN LOVES

00:47:00.951 --> 00:47:01.919
SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY. IN

00:47:01.985 --> 00:47:04.021
ADDITION, THEY STRONGLY

00:47:04.087 --> 00:47:04.755
SUPPORTED EDUCATION,

00:47:04.821 --> 00:47:07.224
HUMANITARIAN SERVICES, PEACE AND

00:47:07.291 --> 00:47:08.392
JUSTICE. GROWING UP IN NEW YORK

00:47:08.458 --> 00:47:10.394
CITY, JOAN EXPERIENCED THE

00:47:10.460 --> 00:47:11.528
WONDERS OF ARTS AND CULTURE

00:47:11.595 --> 00:47:13.330
THROUGH THE EYES OF A CHILD.

00:47:13.397 --> 00:47:14.731
LATER SHE BECAME A CHAMPION OF

00:47:14.798 --> 00:47:16.567
THE ARTS. SHE HELPED TO BUILD

00:47:16.633 --> 00:47:17.868
MUSEUMS, PUBLIC AND PRIVATE ART

00:47:17.935 --> 00:47:18.936
COLLECTIONS, THE SAN DIEGO

00:47:19.002 --> 00:47:21.505
SYMPHONY AND A NEW STATE OF THE

