ART CONCERT VENUE, WHICH MY

00:47:22.673 --> 00:47:23.707
COLLEAGUE REFERRED TO THE RADY

00:47:23.774 --> 00:47:25.609
SHELL AT JACOBS PARK. SHE

00:47:25.676 --> 00:47:27.044
PERSONALLY CHOSE PIECES OF THE

00:47:27.110 --> 00:47:28.812
JOAN KLEIN JACOBS HEALING ARTS

00:47:28.879 --> 00:47:30.480
COLLECTION THAT WERE INSTALLED

00:47:30.547 --> 00:47:31.481
THROUGHOUT THE JACOBS MEDICAL

00:47:31.548 --> 00:47:33.517
CENTER AT UC SAN DIEGO BECAUSE

00:47:33.584 --> 00:47:34.585
SHE BELIEVED IN THE HEALING

00:47:34.651 --> 00:47:37.187
POWER OF ART. IN ADDITION TO

00:47:37.254 --> 00:47:38.188
FINANCIAL SUPPORT, SHE

00:47:38.255 --> 00:47:40.390
VOLUNTEERED HER TIME AND SERVED

00:47:40.457 --> 00:47:41.491
ON PRIVATE BOARDS AND PUBLIC

00:47:41.558 --> 00:47:42.893
COMMISSIONS. IN 2008, SHE

00:47:42.960 --> 00:47:44.061
RECEIVED AN HONORARY DOCTORATE

00:47:44.127 --> 00:47:46.163
IN FINE ARTS FROM THE UNIVERSITY

00:47:46.230 --> 00:47:47.831
OF MASSACHUSETTS. SOON AFTER HER

00:47:47.898 --> 00:47:49.666
GRADUATION, JOAN BEGAN

00:47:49.733 --> 00:47:50.667
CONTRIBUTING TO CORNELL,

00:47:50.734 --> 00:47:54.137
EVENTUALLY, A COMBINED GIFTS FOR

00:47:54.204 --> 00:47:55.205
EDUCATION AND RESEARCH ROSE TO

00:47:55.272 --> 00:47:56.673
THE HUNDREDS OF MILLIONS OF

00:47:56.740 --> 00:47:58.408
DOLLARS JOAN AND IRWIN ENDOWED

00:47:58.475 --> 00:48:00.110
CHAIRS AND SCHOLARSHIPS. THEY

00:48:00.177 --> 00:48:01.278
CONTRIBUTED TO THE CONSTRUCTION

00:48:01.345 --> 00:48:02.212
OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY

00:48:02.279 --> 00:48:04.014
CENTERS, HOSPITALS, LABS, AND

00:48:04.081 --> 00:48:06.783
RESEARCH INSTITUTES SUPPORTING

00:48:06.850 --> 00:48:07.851
EDUCATION WAS A PRIORITY FOR

00:48:07.918 --> 00:48:10.320
JOAN BECAUSE BOTH SHE AND IRWIN

00:48:10.387 --> 00:48:10.854
PERSONALLY BENEFITED FROM

00:48:10.921 --> 00:48:11.622
PHILANTHROPIC SUPPORT WHEN THEY

00:48:11.688 --> 00:48:14.324
ATTENDED UNIVERSITY. IRWIN WAS

00:48:14.391 --> 00:48:16.126
HIRED TO BUILD THE SCHOOL OF

00:48:16.193 --> 00:48:17.294
ENGINEERING AT THE NEW

00:48:17.361 --> 00:48:19.329
UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA IN SAN

00:48:19.396 --> 00:48:20.530
DIEGO IN 1966. JOAN WAS A BUSY

00:48:20.597 --> 00:48:23.767
MOTHER OF FOUR SONS, BUT WAS

00:48:23.834 --> 00:48:24.968
ALSO ENGAGED IN THE UNIVERSITY

00:48:25.035 --> 00:48:27.204
COMMUNITY. OVER THE YEARS, SHE

00:48:27.271 --> 00:48:28.405
CHAIRED AND SERVED ON NUMEROUS

00:48:28.472 --> 00:48:30.007
BOARDS AND COMMITTEES AT UC SAN

00:48:30.073 --> 00:48:31.875
DIEGO. SHE EMPHASIZED THE NEED

00:48:31.942 --> 00:48:33.377
FOR A HOLISTIC EDUCATION FOR ALL

00:48:33.443 --> 00:48:35.078
STUDENTS SO THEY WOULD GRADUATE

00:48:35.145 --> 00:48:36.613
AS WELL-ROUNDED, SOCIALLY

00:48:36.680 --> 00:48:39.883
RESPONSIBLE, AND CULTURALLY

00:48:39.950 --> 00:48:40.984
AWARE YOUNG ADULTS, NOT JUST

00:48:41.051 --> 00:48:43.353
BRILLIANT ENGINEERS. IN 2020,

00:48:43.420 --> 00:48:44.421
IRWIN AND JOAN WERE THE

00:48:44.488 --> 00:48:47.024
INAUGURAL RECIPIENTS OF UC SAN

00:48:47.090 --> 00:48:48.258
DIEGO'S LIFETIME LEGACY AWARD.

00:48:48.325 --> 00:48:50.794
FOLLOWING HIS ACADEMIC CAREER,

00:48:50.861 --> 00:48:53.697
IRWIN CO-FOUNDED LINKABIT AND

00:48:53.764 --> 00:48:54.765
THEN QUALCOMM, A HUGELY

00:48:54.831 --> 00:48:57.034
SUCCESSFUL GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY

00:48:57.100 --> 00:48:58.001
COMPANY THAT DEVELOPED THE BASIC

00:48:58.068 --> 00:49:00.237
COMPONENTS OF WIRELESS

00:49:00.304 --> 00:49:01.204
COMMUNICATIONS. JOAN AND IRWIN

00:49:01.271 --> 00:49:03.707
SUPPORT FOR GOOD GOVERNANCE,

00:49:03.774 --> 00:49:05.342
PEACE, AND JUSTICE WILL HAVE

00:49:05.409 --> 00:49:07.110
ENDURING GLOBAL IMPACTS. THEY

00:49:07.177 --> 00:49:10.614
GAVE THE ACLU THE LARGEST

00:49:10.681 --> 00:49:11.782
ENDOWMENT GIFT IN ITS HISTORY.

00:49:11.848 --> 00:49:13.884
THEY FUNDED IN PERPETUITY, THE

00:49:13.950 --> 00:49:15.085
JOAN AND IRWIN JACOBS CENTER FOR

00:49:15.152 --> 00:49:17.554
SHARED SOCIETY, AN INITIATIVE AT

00:49:17.621 --> 00:49:20.924
THE ISRAEL DEMOCRACY INSTITUTE

00:49:20.991 --> 00:49:22.059
THAT AIMS TO STRENGTHEN SOCIAL

00:49:22.125 --> 00:49:24.594
SOLIDARITY AND FOSTER COMMITMENT

00:49:24.661 --> 00:49:25.629
TO DEMOCRATIC VALUES, WITH A

00:49:25.696 --> 00:49:26.797
GOAL OF MEETING THE UNIQUE

00:49:26.863 --> 00:49:28.632
CHALLENGES ARISING FROM ISRAEL'S

00:49:28.699 --> 00:49:31.601
DUAL IDENTITY AS A JEWISH NATION

00:49:31.668 --> 00:49:32.803
STATE AND A LIBERAL DEMOCRACY.

00:49:32.869 --> 00:49:35.906
THEIR GIFT TO THE UC SAN DIEGO

00:49:35.972 --> 00:49:37.040
SCHOOL OF GLOBAL POLICY AND

00:49:37.107 --> 00:49:38.675
STRATEGY SUPPORTS RESEARCH ON

00:49:38.742 --> 00:49:39.676
HOW GLOBAL ECONOMICS AND

00:49:39.743 --> 00:49:42.546
POLITICS ARE CHANGING, AND HOW

00:49:42.612 --> 00:49:43.547
ADVANCES IN SCIENCE AND

00:49:43.613 --> 00:49:45.549
TECHNOLOGY IMPROVE POLICY AND

00:49:45.615 --> 00:49:47.217
ALTER THE DISTRIBUTION OF WEALTH

00:49:47.284 --> 00:49:48.785
AROUND THE WORLD, AND THEIR

00:49:48.852 --> 00:49:51.621
SUPPORT OF THE TÊ INSTITUTE AT

00:49:51.688 --> 00:49:52.856
NATIONAL TSING HUA UNIVERSITY IN

00:49:52.923 --> 00:49:55.292
TAIWAN ENCOURAGES INNOVATION AND

00:49:55.359 --> 00:49:56.226
ENTREPRENEURSHIP. A REOCCURRING

00:49:56.293 --> 00:49:59.930
THEME IN THE STORY OF JOAN

00:49:59.996 --> 00:50:01.098
JACOBS IS THAT THE GIFTS THAT

00:50:01.164 --> 00:50:02.299
SHE AND IRWIN GAVE WERE OFTEN

00:50:02.366 --> 00:50:04.034
THE LARGEST IN THE HISTORY OF

00:50:04.101 --> 00:50:05.001
THE ORGANIZATION THAT THEY

00:50:05.068 --> 00:50:06.603
SUPPORTED. JOAN TOOK HER

00:50:06.670 --> 00:50:07.137
PHILANTHROPIC GIVING VERY

00:50:07.204 --> 00:50:08.839
SERIOUSLY AND FOUND IT

00:50:08.905 --> 00:50:09.406
TREMENDOUSLY FULFILLING. SHE

00:50:09.473 --> 00:50:10.941
HOPED THAT SHE COULD BE A ROLE

00:50:11.007 --> 00:50:13.577
MODEL FOR OTHERS. WE CAN ALL

00:50:13.643 --> 00:50:15.846
LEARN FROM HER ABOUT THE POWER

00:50:15.912 --> 00:50:17.147
AND JOY OF GIVING, REGARDLESS OF

00:50:17.214 --> 00:50:19.249
THE AMOUNT, BECAUSE EVERY GIFT

00:50:19.316 --> 00:50:20.350
MAKES THE DIFFERENCE AND CAN

00:50:20.417 --> 00:50:23.120
CHANGE A LIFE AND HAVE A LASTING

00:50:23.186 --> 00:50:25.355
IMPACT. FOR HER GENEROSITY AND

00:50:25.422 --> 00:50:26.490
COMMITMENT TO CREATING A BETTER

00:50:26.556 --> 00:50:28.859
WORLD, WE HONOR AND THANK JOAN

00:50:28.925 --> 00:50:29.993
KLEIN JACOBS FOR LIGHTING THE

00:50:30.060 --> 00:50:32.062
WAY TO A BETTER FUTURE FOR US

00:50:32.129 --> 00:50:33.296
ALL, AND I ASK THIS BODY TO

00:50:33.363 --> 00:50:35.298
ADJOURN IN HER MEMORY. THANK YOU

00:50:35.365 --> 00:50:36.366
AGAIN. ON BEHALF OF THE

00:50:36.433 --> 00:50:37.434
CALIFORNIA STATE SENATE, WE

00:50:37.501 --> 00:50:38.668
EXTEND OUR DEEPEST CONDOLENCES

00:50:38.735 --> 00:50:39.770
TO THE JACOBS FAMILY. SENATOR

00:50:39.836 --> 00:50:46.076
MARGAVAR. THANK YOU, MR.

00:50:46.143 --> 00:50:49.379
PRESIDENT. COLLEAGUES, I RISE

00:50:49.446 --> 00:50:53.550
TODAY TO LIFT UP THE LIFE AND

00:50:53.617 --> 00:50:56.019
MEMORY OF KAREN LOMBARDO, A

00:50:56.086 --> 00:50:59.289
DEEPLY BELOVED WIFE, MOTHER,

00:50:59.356 --> 00:51:00.257
TEACHER AND BURBANK COMMUNITY

00:51:00.323 --> 00:51:02.726
MEMBER. HER LIFE WAS SUDDENLY

00:51:02.793 --> 00:51:04.394
AND TRAGICALLY TAKEN AWAY LAST

00:51:04.461 --> 00:51:06.997
WEEK ON MAY 7TH AT THE YOUNG AGE

00:51:07.063 --> 00:51:09.199
OF 57, WHEN SHE WAS MURDERED.

00:51:09.266 --> 00:51:11.001
THE ENTIRE CITY OF BURBANK IS

00:51:11.067 --> 00:51:12.869
REELING FROM THE DISTRESSING

00:51:12.936 --> 00:51:15.772
LOSS. KAREN HAS A RARE

00:51:15.839 --> 00:51:16.773
DISTINCTION. WE CAN ACCURATELY

00:51:16.840 --> 00:51:19.309
STATE THAT SHE MADE A PROFOUND

00:51:19.376 --> 00:51:20.477
AND LASTING IMPACT ON THE LIVES

00:51:20.544 --> 00:51:23.213
OF THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE IN HER

00:51:23.280 --> 00:51:24.214
COMMUNITY, NOT JUST HER

00:51:24.281 --> 00:51:27.684
STUDENTS. DURING HER 30 YEARS AT

00:51:27.751 --> 00:51:28.685
BRET HART ELEMENTARY, SHE

00:51:28.752 --> 00:51:31.121
GENEROUSLY EXTENDED HER LOVE OF

00:51:31.188 --> 00:51:32.122
TEACHING TO MULTIPLE ROLES

00:51:32.189 --> 00:51:34.124
BEHIND BEYOND HER KINDERGARTEN

00:51:34.191 --> 00:51:36.993
CLASSES, INCLUDING PERFORMING

00:51:37.060 --> 00:51:37.994
ARTS, CHORUS AND INTERVENTION.

00:51:38.061 --> 00:51:41.064
THE PARENTS APPRECIATED THE

00:51:41.131 --> 00:51:42.732
SAFETY THEY FELT WHEN THEY LEFT

00:51:42.799 --> 00:51:44.534
THEIR CHILDREN IN MISS KAREN'S

00:51:44.601 --> 00:51:47.504
CARE. IN HER DEDICATION TO

00:51:47.571 --> 00:51:48.605
FOSTERING A NURTURING LEARNING

00:51:48.672 --> 00:51:50.907
ENVIRONMENT WAS ALWAYS PRESENT.

00:51:50.974 --> 00:51:54.411
HER COLLEAGUES ADMIRED HER

00:51:54.478 --> 00:51:55.412
COLLABORATIVE SPIRIT IN THE

00:51:55.479 --> 00:51:57.814
WORKPLACE, AND THEY ARE

00:51:57.881 --> 00:51:58.849
DETERMINED TO CONTINUE THE

00:51:58.915 --> 00:52:01.151
LEGACY OF EXCELLENCE. SHE LEFT

00:52:01.218 --> 00:52:02.219
BEHIND. KAREN WENT ABOVE AND

00:52:02.285 --> 00:52:04.788
BEYOND THE DAILY CURRICULUM,

00:52:04.855 --> 00:52:05.722
DEVOTING TIME AND DETAILED

00:52:05.789 --> 00:52:07.991
ATTENTION TO STUDENTS UNIQUE

00:52:08.058 --> 00:52:11.228
GROWTH AND DEVELOPMENTAL NEEDS.

00:52:11.294 --> 00:52:12.295
OUR PUBLIC SCHOOL TEACHERS MAKE

00:52:12.362 --> 00:52:13.730
A DIFFERENCE IN THE FUTURES OF

00:52:13.797 --> 00:52:15.799
EVERY ONE OF THEIR STUDENTS, AND

00:52:15.866 --> 00:52:17.033
BY ALL ACCOUNTS, KAREN

00:52:17.100 --> 00:52:18.068
EXEMPLIFIED THE LIFELONG IMPACT.

00:52:18.134 --> 00:52:20.871
COMPASSION AND POSITIVE SUPPORT

00:52:20.937 --> 00:52:23.874
ONE CAN HAVE IN THE LIFE OF A

00:52:23.940 --> 00:52:25.842
CHILD. AS A TEACHER THAT I KNOW

00:52:25.909 --> 00:52:26.543
SO MANY OF MY COLLEAGUES WHO

00:52:26.610 --> 00:52:27.577
WERE TEACHERS HERE UNDERSTAND

00:52:27.644 --> 00:52:30.113
FIRSTHAND. KAREN PUT THE

00:52:30.180 --> 00:52:31.848
WELL-BEING OF OTHERS FIRST TO

00:52:31.915 --> 00:52:33.216
THE VERY END. HER UNWAVERING

00:52:33.283 --> 00:52:34.251
COMMITMENT TO HER STUDENTS, HER

00:52:34.317 --> 00:52:37.654
LEADERSHIP AS AN EDUCATOR, AND

00:52:37.721 --> 00:52:38.822
HER DEVOTION AS A WIFE AND

00:52:38.889 --> 00:52:40.090
MOTHER CANNOT BE REPLACED. WHAT

00:52:40.156 --> 00:52:41.892
WE CAN LOOK TOWARDS ARE THE

00:52:41.958 --> 00:52:44.561
GENERATIONS OF YOUNG PEOPLE WHO

00:52:44.628 --> 00:52:45.729
WILL GROW AND THRIVE, CARRYING

00:52:45.795 --> 00:52:46.963
ON THE LEGACY OF KAREN'S LIFE

00:52:47.030 --> 00:52:50.367
FOR MANY, MANY YEARS TO COME.

00:52:50.433 --> 00:52:51.501
THIS DISASTER HAS LEFT A HUGE

00:52:51.568 --> 00:52:54.037
VOID IN THE BURBANK COMMUNITY,

00:52:54.104 --> 00:52:56.773
AND I AM SO HONORED TO HAVE THE

00:52:56.840 --> 00:52:57.908
COMMUNITY COME OUT AND SHOW

00:52:57.974 --> 00:52:58.808
THEIR APPRECIATION THROUGH

00:52:58.875 --> 00:53:00.810
VIGILS AND VARIOUS LOCATIONS

00:53:00.877 --> 00:53:03.980
THAT WE'RE PUTTING FLOWERS AND

00:53:04.047 --> 00:53:07.384
SO FORTH FOR THIS WONDERFUL LIFE

00:53:07.450 --> 00:53:08.518
THAT WE LOST. KAREN LEAVES

00:53:08.585 --> 00:53:10.754
BEHIND HER HUSBAND, VINCE

00:53:10.820 --> 00:53:13.256
LOMBARDO, AND THEIR TWO

00:53:13.323 --> 00:53:14.291
CHILDREN. SENATORS, I ASK THAT

00:53:14.357 --> 00:53:16.526
WE ADJOURN IN HER MEMORY TO SHOW

00:53:16.593 --> 00:53:18.495
HER LOVED ONES AND THE STAFF AND

00:53:18.562 --> 00:53:19.663
FAMILIES OF BRET HART ELEMENTARY

00:53:19.729 --> 00:53:20.830
SCHOOL, THAT OUR GRATITUDE AND

00:53:20.897 --> 00:53:23.199
ADMIRATION ARE FOREVER WITH THE

00:53:23.266 --> 00:53:24.301
BURBANK LEADER, KAREN LOMBARDO.

00:53:24.367 --> 00:53:25.936
THANK YOU. THANK YOU, SENATOR

00:53:26.002 --> 00:53:29.573
PORTANTINO. THANK YOU, MR.

00:53:29.639 --> 00:53:31.274
PRESIDENT, AND MEMBERS AND MY

00:53:31.341 --> 00:53:33.743
COLLEAGUE DID A WONDERFUL JOB

00:53:33.810 --> 00:53:36.313
DESCRIBING AND DETAILING THIS

00:53:36.379 --> 00:53:39.783
IMPECCABLE EDUCATOR AND

00:53:39.849 --> 00:53:40.817
WONDERFUL MOM AND COMMUNITY

00:53:40.884 --> 00:53:44.254
MEMBER, THE TRAGEDY OF HER

00:53:44.321 --> 00:53:47.457
PASSING HAS TRULY TOUCHED THE

00:53:47.524 --> 00:53:50.093
COMMUNITY. AS HAS BEEN SAID,

00:53:50.160 --> 00:53:51.294
THIS IS A LIFELONG EDUCATOR WHO

00:53:51.361 --> 00:53:54.664
GAVE BACK TO THE COMMUNITY, WHO

00:53:54.731 --> 00:53:56.933
GAVE BACK TO GENERATIONS, WHO

00:53:57.000 --> 00:53:58.101
GAVE BACK TO CHILDREN, INSPIRED

00:53:58.168 --> 00:54:01.438
SO MANY PEOPLE TO DO WELL. AND

00:54:01.504 --> 00:54:03.573
THAT'S WHY THE COMMUNITY LOVED

00:54:03.640 --> 00:54:04.674
AND EMBRACED HER WHILE SHE WAS

00:54:04.741 --> 00:54:06.443
ALIVE. AND THAT'S WHY THE

00:54:06.509 --> 00:54:08.044
COMMUNITY IS DEEPLY MOURNING HER

00:54:08.111 --> 00:54:11.247
PASSING. TO THIS DAY, THE

00:54:11.314 --> 00:54:11.781
CIRCUMSTANCES AROUND THIS

00:54:11.848 --> 00:54:14.818
TRAGEDY ARE HORRIFIC, BUT THEY

00:54:14.884 --> 00:54:18.221
ALSO UNDERSCORE HOW MUCH SHE

00:54:18.288 --> 00:54:20.557
TRIED TO MITIGATE THOSE

00:54:20.624 --> 00:54:21.625
CIRCUMSTANCES AS A HUMAN BEING

00:54:21.691 --> 00:54:24.661
IN THE IN THE COMMUNITY AND IN

00:54:24.728 --> 00:54:25.762
HER FAMILY THAT CAUSED THIS

00:54:25.829 --> 00:54:27.931
TRAGEDY. AND SO I JOIN MY

00:54:27.998 --> 00:54:30.667
COLLEAGUE IN ASKING THIS CHAMBER

00:54:30.734 --> 00:54:32.469
TO ADJOURN IN MEMORY OF KAREN

00:54:32.535 --> 00:54:34.070
LOMBARDO, A WONDERFUL PERSON,

00:54:34.137 --> 00:54:35.005
FANTASTIC EDUCATOR, AND WHOSE

00:54:35.071 --> 00:54:38.541
LASTING LEGACY WILL CONTINUE TO

00:54:38.608 --> 00:54:39.576
RIPPLE THROUGH CALIFORNIA FOR

00:54:39.643 --> 00:54:41.811
GENERATIONS. SO THANK YOU. THANK

00:54:41.878 --> 00:54:42.912
YOU AGAIN ON BEHALF OF THE

00:54:42.979 --> 00:54:44.781
CALIFORNIA STATE SENATE, WE

00:54:44.848 --> 00:54:45.882
EXTEND OUR DEEPEST CONDOLENCES

00:54:45.949 --> 00:54:47.817
TO THE LOMBARDO FAMILY AND ASK

00:54:47.884 --> 00:54:49.753
THAT YOU BRING THE NAME FORWARD

00:54:49.819 --> 00:54:50.854
SO SHE CAN BE PROPERLY

00:54:50.920 --> 00:54:51.955
MEMORIALIZED. NEXT UP, SENATOR

00:54:52.022 --> 00:54:57.427
RUBIO. THANK YOU, MR. PRESIDENT.

00:54:57.494 --> 00:54:58.495
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN OF THE

00:54:58.561 --> 00:55:00.196
SENATE, TODAY I RISE TO ADJOURN

00:55:00.263 --> 00:55:03.466
IN THE MEMORY OF OCTAVIO GUSTAVO

00:55:03.533 --> 00:55:04.601
BOBIAN, WHO LAUNCHED THE UPWARD

00:55:04.668 --> 00:55:06.903
BOUND PROGRAM AT THE CLAREMONT

00:55:06.970 --> 00:55:09.339
COLLEGES AND WHO PASSED AWAY

00:55:09.406 --> 00:55:11.174
MARCH 14TH AT THE AGE OF 89.

00:55:11.241 --> 00:55:13.877
OCTAVIO WAS A LONGTIME CLAREMONT

00:55:13.943 --> 00:55:16.179
RESIDENT, YET HE TOUCHED SO MANY

00:55:16.246 --> 00:55:17.414
LIVES AND SO MANY STUDENTS WITH

00:55:17.480 --> 00:55:19.482
HIS PROGRAM. THROUGH THE

00:55:19.549 --> 00:55:20.417
PROGRAM, OCTAVIO RECRUITED

00:55:20.483 --> 00:55:23.253
THOUSANDS OF FIRST GENERATION

00:55:23.319 --> 00:55:24.921
LOW INCOME STUDENTS IN MY

00:55:24.988 --> 00:55:27.691
DISTRICT FROM CHINO ALL THE WAY

00:55:27.757 --> 00:55:29.893
TO EL MONTE AND ASSISTED THEM IN

00:55:29.959 --> 00:55:30.927
GETTING INTO COLLEGE, HE TOLD

00:55:30.994 --> 00:55:34.798
HIS CHILDREN THAT HE WAS ON THE

00:55:34.864 --> 00:55:35.932
PATH OF JUVENILE DELINQUENCY,

00:55:35.999 --> 00:55:38.001
BUT WAS ABLE TO JOIN THE

00:55:38.068 --> 00:55:40.837
CLARETIAN SEMINARY IN DOMINGUEZ

00:55:40.904 --> 00:55:42.739
HILL AND LATER ON, LATER ON, HE

00:55:42.806 --> 00:55:44.774
FOLLOWED THE FOOTSTEPS OF HIS

00:55:44.841 --> 00:55:47.043
BROTHER AND JOINED THE MILITARY,

00:55:47.110 --> 00:55:48.111
SERVING IN THE EIGHTH ARMY

00:55:48.178 --> 00:55:50.580
INFANTRY BATTALION PARATROOPER

00:55:50.647 --> 00:55:51.614
UNIT BASED IN FORT BENNING,

00:55:51.681 --> 00:55:54.184
GEORGIA DURING THE KOREAN

00:55:54.250 --> 00:55:57.654
CONFLICT. AFTER GRADUATING FROM

00:55:57.721 --> 00:55:58.822
CAL STATE L.A, OCTAVIO BEGAN A

00:55:58.888 --> 00:56:01.424
CAREER OF SOCIAL WORK AND MOSTLY

00:56:01.491 --> 00:56:02.459
FOCUSED ON BLACK AND BROWN

00:56:02.525 --> 00:56:05.428
LATINO, YOU KNOW, CHILDREN AND

00:56:05.495 --> 00:56:07.764
FAMILIES IN LOS ANGELES COUNTY

00:56:07.831 --> 00:56:08.898
AND HELP THEM ESCAPE POVERTY AND

00:56:08.965 --> 00:56:11.334
HELP PUT THEM IN A PATH OF

00:56:11.401 --> 00:56:12.502
SUCCESS THROUGH THE UPWARD BOUND

00:56:12.569 --> 00:56:15.004
PROGRAM, HE ALSO SAW THE

00:56:15.071 --> 00:56:16.773
OPPORTUNITY TO GIVE HIS STUDENTS

00:56:16.840 --> 00:56:18.441
A BETTER LIFE, THAT A COLLEGE

00:56:18.508 --> 00:56:21.377
EDUCATION WAS AN ENGINE OF

00:56:21.444 --> 00:56:22.378
SOCIAL MOBILITY AND PROSPERITY,

00:56:22.445 --> 00:56:24.814
AND ENCOURAGED THEM TO ATTEND.

00:56:24.881 --> 00:56:28.218
THANKS TO HIM, THE PROGRAM GREW

00:56:28.284 --> 00:56:29.219
INTO A NATIONALLY RECOGNIZED

00:56:29.285 --> 00:56:31.588
MODEL OF EXCELLENCE, DEVELOPING

00:56:31.654 --> 00:56:34.691
THE PROGRAM SO HIS STUDENTS

00:56:34.758 --> 00:56:35.859
WOULD BE EXPOSED TO SCIENCE,

00:56:35.925 --> 00:56:38.194
TECHNOLOGY, POLITICS, POLICY,

00:56:38.261 --> 00:56:41.598
AND THE WILDERNESS. ALTHOUGH

00:56:41.664 --> 00:56:42.065
OCTAVIO SUFFERED FROM

00:56:42.132 --> 00:56:44.734
ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE, AS YOU

00:56:44.801 --> 00:56:46.002
KNOW, IN THE LATER YEARS HE LOST

00:56:46.069 --> 00:56:48.638
HIS FAVORITE IDENTITY, WHICH WAS

00:56:48.705 --> 00:56:51.541
BEING A FATHER AND A HUSBAND AND

00:56:51.608 --> 00:56:52.642
MANY WILL REMEMBER HIM, EVEN

00:56:52.709 --> 00:56:55.779
THOUGH HE DIDN'T HAVE HIS

00:56:55.845 --> 00:56:58.715
MEMORY. IN THE END, SO MANY WILL

00:56:58.782 --> 00:57:00.483
REMEMBER HIM, NOT ONLY BECAUSE

00:57:00.550 --> 00:57:02.919
OF WHAT HE DID FOR DISADVANTAGED

00:57:02.986 --> 00:57:05.088
CHILDREN, BUT BECAUSE THEY Þ HIS

00:57:05.155 --> 00:57:06.189
SUCCESS. THEIR SUCCESS IN LATER

00:57:06.256 --> 00:57:09.592
LIFE, AND THEIR CAREERS TO THE

00:57:09.659 --> 00:57:12.295
UPWARD UPWARD BOUND PROGRAM. HE

00:57:12.362 --> 00:57:14.597
LEAVES BEHIND HIS WIFE, SEVEN

00:57:14.664 --> 00:57:17.367
CHILDREN AND 17 GRANDCHILDREN. A

00:57:17.433 --> 00:57:18.401
COMMUNITY WILL FLOURISH BECAUSE

00:57:18.468 --> 00:57:21.337
OF WHAT HE LEFT BEHIND AND HIS

00:57:21.404 --> 00:57:22.338
CONTRIBUTIONS. PLEASE HELP ME

00:57:22.405 --> 00:57:25.141
JOIN IN ADJOURNING IN THE MEMORY

00:57:25.208 --> 00:57:27.744
OF OCTAVIO GUSTAVO BOBIAN. THANK

00:57:27.811 --> 00:57:29.612
YOU. THANK YOU. ON BEHALF OF THE

00:57:29.679 --> 00:57:31.481
CALIFORNIA STATE SENATE, WE

00:57:31.548 --> 00:57:32.615
EXTEND OUR DEEPEST CONDOLENCES

00:57:32.682 --> 00:57:34.684
AND ASK THAT YOU BRING HIS NAME

00:57:34.751 --> 00:57:35.919
FORWARD SO IT CAN BE PROPERLY

00:57:35.985 --> 00:57:37.387
MEMORIALIZED IN THE JOURNAL, IF

00:57:37.453 --> 00:57:38.488
THERE'S NO OTHER BUSINESS,

00:57:38.555 --> 00:57:40.690
SENATOR GROVE, THE DUST IS

00:57:40.757 --> 00:57:41.891
CLEAR. THANK YOU, MR. PRESIDENT.

